        "en": "Comforting approach for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize how well the clinic accommodates nervous dogs and cats during checkups and surgical procedures. Pet owners note that visiting animals remain calm and relaxed in the examination rooms, with staff providing thoughtful calming touches like lavender handkerchiefs to reduce stress."
      }
    },
